  "goodToKnow": "Unabdingbar means indispensable or essential, a formal word: eine unabdingbare Voraussetzung, für den Erfolg unabdingbar. It comes from the old verb abdingen (to bargain away), so it literally means not negotiable. In law, unabdingbare Rechte cannot be waived by contract. Synonyms: unerlässlich, unverzichtbar, zwingend notwendig."
